      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bEe",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2039141899,
      "version": 477,
      "versionNonce": 245454343,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784818612371,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The main reason is:\nWeb servers and Python applications speak different languages. WSGI acts as a translator between them.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The main reason is:\nWeb servers and Python applications speak different languages. WSGI acts as a translator between them.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "D5NqcL6KtgQgB2ombyFIQ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2000.1342546076967,
      "y": -246.8711271569191,
      "width": 891,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bEf",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 807739499,
      "version": 519,
      "versionNonce": 659304937,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784818612371,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1️⃣ First Understand the Problem\n    A web server like Nginx or Apache HTTP Server only understands HTTP protocol.\n    Example request from browser:",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1️⃣ First Understand the Problem\n    A web server like Nginx or Apache HTTP Server only understands HTTP protocol.\n    Example request from browser:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "9fCwfTIBaNXFrPg78ie2G",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2039.3530046076967,
      "y": -132.6055021569191,
      "width": 891,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bEg",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1241108549,
      "version": 534,
      "versionNonce": 1748434215,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784818612371,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "GET /users HTTP/1.1\nHost: example.com\n\nBut your Python app (like Django or Flask) understands Python code, not raw HTTP.\nSo the question is:\nHow will HTTP requests become Python function calls?\nThis is where WSGI comes in.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "GET /users HTTP/1.1\nHost: example.com\n\nBut your Python app (like Django or Flask) understands Python code, not raw HTTP.\nSo the question is:\nHow will HTTP requests become Python function calls?\nThis is where WSGI comes in.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "7dBCU5fVE5yM6_ZtzDSYX",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2029.0951921076967,
      "y": 74.8280915930809,
      "width": 396,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bEi",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1546444357,
      "version": 444,
      "versionNonce": 413142217,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784818612371,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2️⃣ What WSGI Actually Does?\nThink of WSGI as a translator layer.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2️⃣ What WSGI Actually Does?\nThink of WSGI as a translator layer.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "qlJyNn3iymzcbRiyA8jQG",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2097.0990983576967,
      "y": 159.6991853430809,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 325,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bEj",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 461823755,
      "version": 418,
      "versionNonce": 1254801479,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784818612371,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Browser\n   │\n   ▼\nHTTP Request\n   │\n   ▼\nWeb Server (Nginx)\n   │\n   ▼\nWSGI Server (Gunicorn / uWSGI)\n   │\n   ▼\nPython App (Django / Flask)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Browser\n   │\n   ▼\nHTTP Request\n   │\n   ▼\nWeb Server (Nginx)\n   │\n   ▼\nWSGI Server (Gunicorn / uWSGI)\n   │\n   ▼\nPython App (Django / Flask)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Zgu4t4vku0AtkqtYxR2fw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2037.6420671076967,
      "y": 508.1562165930809,
      "width": 154,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bEk",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 237101835,
      "version": 399,
      "versionNonce": 745900969,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784818612371,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "WSGI converts:",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "WSGI converts:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "CArBlV-YZXUz8_0CVuAii",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2074.2084733576967,
      "y": 543.5585603430809,
      "width": 341,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bEm",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 784470027,
      "version": 343,
      "versionNonce": 674832231,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784818612371,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "HTTP request  →  Python objects\nPython response → HTTP response\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "HTTP request  →  Python objects\nPython response → HTTP response\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "aVeRXFw1tk8sm1Lf2bRp1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2036.9076921076967,
      "y": 639.0429353430809,
      "width": 308,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bEn",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 10949285,
      "version": 242,
      "versionNonce": 1794649737,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784818612371,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3️⃣ Real Example Without WSGI\nSuppose a request comes:",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3️⃣ Real Example Without WSGI\nSuppose a request comes:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "_Z9GdIbR0YwHpcCayzZpM",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2079.6928483576967,
      "y": 707.7655915930809,
      "width": 484,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bEo",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2006609477,
      "version": 239,
      "versionNonce": 47094407,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784818612371,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "raw_request = \"GET /products?id=10 HTTP/1.1\"\n\n# parse method\n# parse headers\n# parse body\n# route request",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "raw_request = \"GET /products?id=10 HTTP/1.1\"\n\n# parse method\n# parse headers\n# parse body\n# route request",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "QLxXNKS98cbQUKvz95kmF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2072.3022233576967,
      "y": 875.6835603430809,
      "width": 363,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bEp",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1796465445,
      "version": 287,
      "versionNonce": 1256420713,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784818612371,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "That would be extremely complex.\nSo WSGI handles all this for you.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "That would be extremely complex.\nSo WSGI handles all this for you.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "oQua7TCqolb_gd0TxZ46K",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2004.6850358576967,
      "y": 981.1874665930809,
      "width": 627,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bEq",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 69018501,
      "version": 244,
      "versionNonce": 1598534055,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784818612371,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4️⃣ What WSGI Gives to Django?\nInstead of raw HTTP, Django receives a Python dictionary.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4️⃣ What WSGI Gives to Django?\nInstead of raw HTTP, Django receives a Python dictionary.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Xs4W94YkOf1yWu8y_JFDj",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2057.2319108576967,
      "y": 1054.390591593081,
      "width": 429,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bEr",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1770223077,
      "version": 245,
      "versionNonce": 1602412617,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784818612371,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "environ = {\n    \"REQUEST_METHOD\": \"GET\",\n    \"PATH_INFO\": \"/products\",\n    \"QUERY_STRING\": \"id=10\",\n}\n\nNow Django can easily process:\nif environ[\"PATH_INFO\"] == \"/products\":\n    return product_view()",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "environ = {\n    \"REQUEST_METHOD\": \"GET\",\n    \"PATH_INFO\": \"/products\",\n    \"QUERY_STRING\": \"id=10\",\n}\n\nNow Django can easily process:\nif environ[\"PATH_INFO\"] == \"/products\":\n    return product_view()",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "tcrxzd5kPMc10x1AF5OWS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1993.4584733576967,
      "y": 1341.937466593081,
      "width": 275,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bEs",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2041106725,
      "version": 245,
      "versionNonce": 1993401543,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784818612371,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "5️⃣ How Response Goes Back\nYour Django view returns:",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "5️⃣ How Response Goes Back\nYour Django view returns:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "qv53y43I5AV5cULJ4IwfZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2047.6381608576967,
      "y": 1408.390591593081,
      "width": 1067,
      "height": 275,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bEt",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 865628741,
      "version": 250,
      "versionNonce": 1186066217,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784818612371,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "return JsonResponse({\"id\": 10, \"name\": \"Phone\"})\nWSGI converts it into HTTP:\n\nHTTP/1.1 200 OK\nContent-Type: application/json\n{\"id\":10,\"name\":\"Phone\"}\n\n✅ Final Interview Line\n\nWSGI is a specification that acts as a bridge between a web server and a Python web application, \nconverting HTTP requests into Python objects and Python responses back into HTTP responses.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "return JsonResponse({\"id\": 10, \"name\": \"Phone\"})\nWSGI converts it into HTTP:\n\nHTTP/1.1 200 OK\nContent-Type: application/json\n{\"id\":10,\"name\":\"Phone\"}\n\n✅ Final Interview Line\n\nWSGI is a specification that acts as a bridge between a web server and a Python web application, \nconverting HTTP requests into Python objects and Python responses back into HTTP responses.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "4SQLaXkPc51XlTTuectL8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1941.3256608576967,
      "y": 1755.062466593081,
      "width": 506,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bEu",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 272067851,
      "version": 241,
      "versionNonce": 688305127,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784818612371,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "what actually make django as wsgi application?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "what actually make django as wsgi application?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "0cwbgMZ21ns3TXxqyhvoy",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1991.1615983576967,
      "y": 1799.906216593081,
      "width": 957,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bEv",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1161623723,
      "version": 243,
      "versionNonce": 1457267209,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784818612371,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Django becomes a WSGI application because it exposes a callable named application that \nfollows the WSGI specification.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Django becomes a WSGI application because it exposes a callable named application that \nfollows the WSGI specification.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "TOPN9UAGgkDp1j-pMvWsr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1993.4740983576967,
      "y": 1896.378872843081,
      "width": 858,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bEw",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 243883435,
      "version": 241,
      "versionNonce": 771071751,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784818612371,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1️⃣ What Makes Any App a WSGI Application?\nA program is a WSGI application if it provides a callable with this signature:",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1️⃣ What Makes Any App a WSGI Application?\nA program is a WSGI application if it provides a callable with this signature:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "qVw1NVRu50zVOtLw1R6VJ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2039.9662858576967,
      "y": 1961.589810343081,
      "width": 627,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bEx",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 970357771,
      "version": 246,
      "versionNonce": 217905385,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784818612371,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "application(environ, start_response)\n\nenviron → dictionary containing request data\nstart_response → function used to send status and headers",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "application(environ, start_response)\n\nenviron → dictionary containing request data\nstart_response → function used to send status and headers",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "5-JKm1T5MRLiidto0e9Yi",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1902.1615983576967,
      "y": 2121.355435343081,
      "width": 638,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bEy",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 31511749,
      "version": 242,
      "versionNonce": 135931431,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784818612371,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "in wsgi workers can handle multiple requeest concurrently?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "in wsgi workers can handle multiple requeest concurrently?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "q-O0WC0N1CT9zWAySNhaB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1951.7944108576967,
      "y": 2166.894497843081,
      "width": 1023,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bEz",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1709823077,
      "version": 241,
      "versionNonce": 983561161,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784818612371,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "No. A single WSGI worker usually handles only one request at a time.\nBut the server can run multiple workers, so many requests can still be processed in parallel.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "No. A single WSGI worker usually handles only one request at a time.\nBut the server can run multiple workers, so many requests can still be processed in parallel.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "7kKhLIJGVbIqSWD-lf36x",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1948.6576921076967,
      "y": 2248.460904093081,
      "width": 726,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bF0",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 27043845,
      "version": 247,
      "versionNonce": 912312647,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784818612371,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1️⃣ Basic WSGI Worker Behavior\nIn traditional WSGI servers like Gunicorn or uWSGI (sync workers):",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1️⃣ Basic WSGI Worker Behavior\nIn traditional WSGI servers like Gunicorn or uWSGI (sync workers):",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "2Keh1YRS5rKgfQ4X8_WJF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1983.3373796076967,
      "y": 2309.285122843081,
      "width": 781,
      "height": 350,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bF1",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1722403653,
      "version": 334,
      "versionNonce": 1944097449,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784818612371,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1 Worker  →  1 Request at a time\nWorker 1 → Request A\nWorker 2 → Request B\nWorker 3 → Request C\n\nEach worker processes its request completely before taking another one.\nSo inside a worker:\nRequest 1 starts\n↓\nRequest 1 finishes\n↓\nRequest 2 starts\n\nNo concurrency inside the worker.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1 Worker  →  1 Request at a time\nWorker 1 → Request A\nWorker 2 → Request B\nWorker 3 → Request C\n\nEach worker processes its request completely before taking another one.\nSo inside a worker:\nRequest 1 starts\n↓\nRequest 1 finishes\n↓\nRequest 2 starts\n\nNo concurrency inside the worker.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "jW_79yDJYMCb5lXbVWmUw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1939.0053483576967,
      "y": 2693.085904093081,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bF2",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 282756197,
      "version": 243,
      "versionNonce": 640026727,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784818612371,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2️⃣ How Multiple Requests Are Handled\nConcurrency comes from multiple workers.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2️⃣ How Multiple Requests Are Handled\nConcurrency comes from multiple workers.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "oS0tdVQoqpyGWROpDVzxE",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1990.8256608576967,
      "y": 2759.117154093081,
      "width": 407,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bF3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1831246155,
      "version": 245,
      "versionNonce": 1030378889,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784818612371,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Gunicorn workers = 4\nWorker1 → Request1\nWorker2 → Request2\nWorker3 → Request3\nWorker4 → Request4\n\nSo 4 requests can run simultaneously.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Gunicorn workers = 4\nWorker1 → Request1\nWorker2 → Request2\nWorker3 → Request3\nWorker4 → Request4\n\nSo 4 requests can run simultaneously.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "YZ4aIjGqxeSvomxu3xkZo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1929.9155046076967,
      "y": 2976.535122843081,
      "width": 407,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bF5",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1348930699,
      "version": 240,
      "versionNonce": 1698063239,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784818612371,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3️⃣ What Happens If a Request Is Slow?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3️⃣ What Happens If a Request Is Slow?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "F750DzbHi1BqnLW5DIqYS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1974.0912858576967,
      "y": 3017.574185343081,
      "width": 407,
      "height": 275,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bF6",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2116347979,
      "version": 253,
      "versionNonce": 2054732905,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784818612371,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Worker1 → API call taking 5 seconds\nThat worker is blocked for 5 seconds.\nIt cannot process another request.\n\nWorker1 → Busy\nWorker2 → Available\nWorker3 → Available\nWorker4 → Available\n\nIf all workers become busy:\nRequest5 → waits in queue",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Worker1 → API call taking 5 seconds\nThat worker is blocked for 5 seconds.\nIt cannot process another request.\n\nWorker1 → Busy\nWorker2 → Available\nWorker3 → Available\nWorker4 → Available\n\nIf all workers become busy:\nRequest5 → waits in queue",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ACTdLPOxKbl0C9YDDmOZz",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1919.7865983576967,
      "y": 3333.382779093081,
      "width": 484,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bF7",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1889941323,
      "version": 244,
      "versionNonce": 332290727,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784818612371,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4️⃣ Why This Happens\nWSGI was designed for synchronous execution.\nThat means the flow is:",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4️⃣ Why This Happens\nWSGI was designed for synchronous execution.\nThat means the flow is:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "rwo17gQLBbJLbYkp4k-CA",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1976.0795671076967,
      "y": 3423.812466593081,
      "width": 209,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bFA",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 890741931,
      "version": 165,
      "versionNonce": 450316105,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784818612371,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Receive request\n↓\nProcess request\n↓\nReturn response\n↓\nHandle next request\n\nNo async/await.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Receive request\n↓\nProcess request\n↓\nReturn response\n↓\nHandle next request\n\nNo async/await.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "l74oKRhM0fSNfNDHMghTp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1916.1381608576967,
      "y": 3702.816372843081,
      "width": 473,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bFC",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1607598059,
      "version": 162,
      "versionNonce": 379219399,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784818612371,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "5️⃣ Threaded Workers (Exception)\nSome WSGI servers allow threads per worker.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "5️⃣ Threaded Workers (Exception)\nSome WSGI servers allow threads per worker.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "QQHW5Dd0LcfiiikWwK9jQ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1972.6733171076967,
      "y": 3771.499966593081,
      "width": 363,
      "height": 375,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bFD",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 702314469,
      "version": 172,
      "versionNonce": 148993577,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784818612371,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Gunicorn\nworker_class = gthread\nthreads = 4\n\n1 worker → 4 threads → 4 requests\n\nWorker1\n   Thread1 → Request1\n   Thread2 → Request2\n   Thread3 → Request3\n   Thread4 → Request4\n\nBut still:\nthreads share memory\nCPU bound tasks still block",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Gunicorn\nworker_class = gthread\nthreads = 4\n\n1 worker → 4 threads → 4 requests\n\nWorker1\n   Thread1 → Request1\n   Thread2 → Request2\n   Thread3 → Request3\n   Thread4 → Request4\n\nBut still:\nthreads share memory\nCPU bound tasks still block",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "qoNvjzvSGRLhMih5mask3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1898.4584733576967,
      "y": 4184.230435343081,
      "width": 726,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bFE",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1287437323,
      "version": 162,
      "versionNonce": 146218215,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784818612371,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "6️⃣ Compare With ASGI\nFrameworks like FastAPI or async Django use Uvicorn (ASGI server).",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "6️⃣ Compare With ASGI\nFrameworks like FastAPI or async Django use Uvicorn (ASGI server).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "t2sj21fZxW4uFS3CXaOkj",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1950.8569108576967,
      "y": 4250.581997843081,
      "width": 385,
      "height": 250,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bFF",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 845179333,
      "version": 171,
      "versionNonce": 1468188937,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784818612371,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ASGI allows:\n1 worker → many concurrent requests\n\nWorker\n   Request1 waiting DB\n   Request2 processing\n   Request3 waiting API\n   Request4 processing\n\nBecause of async event loop.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ASGI allows:\n1 worker → many concurrent requests\n\nWorker\n   Request1 waiting DB\n   Request2 processing\n   Request3 waiting API\n   Request4 processing\n\nBecause of async event loop.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "DICblCUfv8yNX59XjDUCd",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1897.5990983576967,
      "y": 4565.796841593081,
      "width": 286,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bFG",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 673252075,
      "version": 164,
      "versionNonce": 1840310279,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784818612371,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "7️⃣ Real Production Example\nTypical Django WSGI setup:",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "7️⃣ Real Production Example\nTypical Django WSGI setup:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "WE8PyfjCSV55wLvcLRCjr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1957.0170671076967,
      "y": 4637.894497843081,
      "width": 275,
      "height": 300,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bFH",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1628383211,
      "version": 176,
      "versionNonce": 808894441,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784818612371,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Nginx\n  ↓\nGunicorn (8 workers)\n  ↓\nDjango\n\nCapacity:\n    8 concurrent requests\n\nIf 100 users hit the API:\n    8 active\n    92 waiting",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Nginx\n  ↓\nGunicorn (8 workers)\n  ↓\nDjango\n\nCapacity:\n    8 concurrent requests\n\nIf 100 users hit the API:\n    8 active\n    92 waiting",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "aGY8El9ACFM1GA4JUtnO6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1891.8803483576967,
      "y": 4990.906216593081,
      "width": 1067,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bFI",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1473058859,
      "version": 162,
      "versionNonce": 595873575,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784818612371,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "8️⃣ Simple Interview Answer\n\nIn WSGI synchronous workers, one worker handles one request at a time. Concurrency is achieved by\n running multiple workers or threads.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "8️⃣ Simple Interview Answer\n\nIn WSGI synchronous workers, one worker handles one request at a time. Concurrency is achieved by\n running multiple workers or threads.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
